From 82a5456054cb75061b17e2ac690c058b6040167a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:09:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Labels of a list start where the English ones start

The status page's stat names (HAPPINESS, SPEED, BRAINS in every language) start where the native words of their list
start (Tired, Off., Def.), the technique panel's labels all start at the English column, and each Techset header (MP
included, now in each language's rows; and the Final row's) starts over the first pixel of its value column, with two
clear columns between neighbours. The crop rows come from tools/localize/systemw.py crop_tables (STAT_LEFT, PANEL_LEFT,
TECH_HEADER_LEFT, TECH_MP_LEFT); tools/test_label_rows.py checks them.
---
